Description: flvmux: test: Fix test_video_caps_late by avoiding depending on timing
 The late-caps test waits for the muxer to observe missing video caps and
 uses timestamped input buffers instead of sleeps and counted clock cranks.
 Only the gst-plugins-good test hunk is carried; the monorepo validate
 blacklist change is outside this source package.
Origin: backport, https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/commit/6e4d5222c26cf5d719df9409d26bdf51f2130555
Author: Dominique Leroux
Bug: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/issues/786
Forwarded: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/merge_requests/12910
Last-Update: 2026-11-23

